{
  "description": "Inherited create-time values, one case per tier. sources is the input, written by hand: what the web reads from existing APIs, in their response shapes (template: a template list item, whose agentConfig is the template's own scion-agent.yaml snapshot and whose defaultHarnessConfig is its declared default_harness_config, the hub's template harness-config rung, ptone/scion#3914; the hub reads job keys (model, message_mode) from it and ignores any environment key (image, telemetry, reserved env) a template sets, ptone/scion#4222; the template row has no config or image, ptone/scion#4224; projectSettings: GET /api/v1/projects/{id}/settings; hubSettings: GET /api/v1/settings/public). dispatched is generated from the hub's actual dispatch by go test ./pkg/hub -run TestCreateAgent_InheritedValuesGolden -update, by the web form's field key, for an agent created with no config keys. The web's inherited-placeholder test checks its placeholders against dispatched.",
